## Getting Started

### 1. Provision Terraform Backend

Run the one-time workflow **0.1** to create the S3 state bucket and DynamoDB lock table.

### 2. Set Up CI Role and GitHub Secrets

Run workflow **0.2** to create the OIDC-linked IAM role and populate GitHub environment secrets/variables.

### 3. Deploy Infrastructure

Run workflow **1** to plan and apply the Terraform stack for your chosen environment.

